        "block_description": "<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In today's rapidly evolving landscape, organizations that successfully bridge technical data innovation with business strategy gain a significant competitive advantage. This meetup brings together diverse perspectives from both engineering and business domains to explore how modern data architectures and AI solutions can deliver tangible value.</span>",
